## Notes: Skyborne Feral Druid levelling route for WoW Forever (Alliance, bear 10-20 and cat from 20, Skinning + Mining), generated from the Forever Alliance guide by tooling/build_variant.py. 2026.11.02: first full build - Zephras Isle 1-14 (two hand-written chapters with the Bear Form pair at 10), the Dalaran-Stormwind join leg with the Cure Poison chain through Moonglade, Auberdine and Darnassus at 14, then chapters 02-26 with the druid class thread (Aquatic Form at 17-18, the Windborne Cat Spirit quests and Cat Form at 20, trainer stops in the Stormwind Park, Darnassus and Moonglade, Exploring the Alliance), feral gear calls after every reward, bear/cat notes and per-boss loot calls in every dungeon. Unverified items are marked in the text; the test list is docs/druid-build-2026-11-02.md. 2 Nov (research pass): Skyborne racial values updated to the 26 Oct beta notes, the Shen'dar profession trainers confirmed, Earthroot vendor prices, Cliffspring cave contents and the Stormwind AH position filled in. 3 Nov (launch dev notes): Lacerate is a Feral talent on Forever, not a trainer rank - dropped from the trainer lines in 13-15; rebuilt on the 3 Nov shaman source (cloth Int gear calls rescored after Mental Dexterity went to 150% of Int).
